verify.body:
Please confirm your email address for ALVOXIS Flow by opening this link:
{link}

The link expires in 24 hours.

reset.body:
We received a request to reset your ALVOXIS Flow password. Open this link to choose a new password:
{link}

The link expires in 1 hour and can be used once. If you did not request this, ignore this email — your password stays unchanged.

newSignIn.body:
Your ALVOXIS Flow account was signed in on {time} (UTC) from {device}.
If this was not you, change your password and sign out other sessions:
{link}

invitation.body:
{inviter} invites you to join {company} in ALVOXIS Flow. Open this link to accept:
{link}

If you do not have an account yet, sign up with this email address first, then open the link again. The link expires in {days} days.
